users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":8,"closed_issues":4466,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-02-14T11:52:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T23:48:31Z","due_on":"2025-03-03T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-01-15T16:52:40Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T16:16:50Z","closed_at":"2025-01-20T16:16:48Z","assignee":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.4.beta.custom_build [4ce466d7f]\n\n### System information\n\nLinux v4.4.beta.custom_build [4ce466d7f]\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen attaching a script to a scene file, the scene file references the script file by its path, not its uid.\nIf I move the script externally (moving the uid file along with it) my scene is broken when I get back in the editor.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d253b86e-e9e6-4236-9052-2a6e0be93f51\n\nIn the above video, I attach a script to my scene. I then move the script to another directory, in vscode, bringing its uid along with it.\n\nAs you can see I use a feature of vscode called \"file nesting\", which allows me to unclutter my IDE and makes vscode automatically move, rename and delete uids when I change the associated script file. (maybe this should be in the godot documentation, it's a nice workflow)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/57d459d5-48b8-437d-87d1-cd6b70089bf2)\n\nBut, since uids are not used in the scene file, the editor does not pick up on the change.\nAs soon as I go back to the editor, my scene becomes broken as it still references the old path.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n- I downloaded the editor from the latest gh action build (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/actions/runs/12773670530). I picked `linux-editor-mono` for my test\n- I added a `_sc_` file inside the editor directory to launch it in self-contained mode to avoid any configuration issue (see [the doc](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/io/data_paths.html#self-contained-mode))\n- I deleted the `.godot` file from the existing project\n- I opened the project with the editor\n- Added a new script to the scene\n- saved the scene\n- used `cat main.tscn` to get the content:\n\n```tscn\n[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3 uid=\"uid://bl5d2erorek5n\"]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://main.gd\" id=\"1_ig7tw\"]\n\n[node name=\"Main\" type=\"Node3D\"]\nscript = ExtResource(\"1_ig7tw\")\n```\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fdb92a0a-f267-4c55-8c74-9fc0a4598bd6\n\nThe project I opened just contains a scene file to make the repro a bit shorter. Here is the zip file, but it really is nothing special:\n\n[test-uids.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18429830/test-uids.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101591/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101591/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}